# [fn [...xs] xs] can be called with multiple positional arguments.
# The variadic param xs collects all positional args into a Seq cons-list at runtime.
# The type checker assigns Seq(T) to xs; the runtime now uses Seq (type and runtime aligned).
[f: [fn [...xs] xs]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(xs), "result": Seq(Int(10), ...)})
